OL,3,GNEWSAExtreme summer weather hits
OL,4,AChristmas tree crop
OL,5,
OL,6,FChristmas tree farmers believe recent
OL,7,Fextreme weather will hit the number of
OL,8,Ftrees available to buyers in future
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FSaplings and young trees have been
OL,12,Fthose most at risk, and farmers have
OL,13,Freported thousands dying over the hot
OL,14,Fsummer months.
OL,16,FAs the trees going on sale this winter
OL,17,Fwere typically planted at least five
OL,18,Fyears ago, the effect is unlikely to be
OL,19,Fseen yet.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
