OL,3,GNEWSAExtreme summer weather hits
OL,4,AChristmas tree crop
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut farmers in the West Midlands said
OL,7,Fthe loss of saplings and young trees
OL,8,Fover the last couple of years would be
OL,9,Ffelt further down the line, and they
OL,10,Fwere changing when they plant the trees
OL,11,Fto adapt.
